# .env.example for skill `kapso-whatsapp-send`
# Aggregated into <scope>/skills/kapso-whatsapp-send/config/.env by
# `make -C skillshub setup-env`. Fill in the real values in your
# operator-config.yaml (secrets.KAPSO_API_KEY / secrets.KAPSO_PHONE_NUMBER_ID),
# NOT here.
#
# KAPSO_API_KEY        — project-scoped Kapso API key. The kapso CLI reads it
#                        directly from the environment (no browser/login).
# KAPSO_PHONE_NUMBER_ID — Presto's own WhatsApp number (the Meta phone-number
#                        ID). The skill's scripts/kapso-run.sh wrapper injects
#                        it as `--phone-number-id` so every send goes out from
#                        Presto's number.

KAPSO_API_KEY=
KAPSO_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
